    "title": "Vian Wolverines Overwhelm The Warner Eagles in Week 6. - NewsBreak",
    "text": "11 hours ago VIAN – The Vian Wolverines put together a dominant offensive performance and delivered a pair of defensive touchdowns to defeat the Warner Eagles, 44–14, in Week 6. Vian wasted little time establishing control, using explosive plays on the ground and through the air to build an early lead. The Wolverines struck first when Wright broke loose for a 71-yard touchdown run, followed by a successful two-point conversion from Madsen to make it 8–0. Read full article",
